strings |id, value|

bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_render_float_fractional_height_dropped_2026-11-28, 0, "Chrome 159, k=4, inside a 50px block: <div style='float:left;width:100px;height:10.75px'> then <div style='clear:both;height:5px'>. Chrome paints the float on device rows 0..42 and the cleared block from 43; Simple put the cleared block at 40 (it then painted over the float's last 3 rows). Same class: the auto height of a flow-root parent holding the float, a float stacked below it, a float below a 5.5px block or with a 2.5px top / 3.5px bottom margin (off at k=1 too)."
    web_render_float_fractional_height_dropped_2026-11-28, 1, "Cause: the float context (float_ctx_*, g_float_y1) kept whole CSS px bottoms and a float took a whole-px top, so the fraction was lost before clearance read it. The float's own box was already right at k=4."

bugs_active |id, severity, status, title, file, line, reproducible_by, created_at, updated_at, valid|
    web_render_float_fractional_height_dropped_2026-11-28, P2, fixed, "web render: a float's authored fractional height is dropped; a clear sibling starts high", src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/browser_engine/simple_web_html_layout_renderer_layout_engine.spl, 83, test/01_unit/browser_engine/float_fractional_height_clear_chrome159_spec.spl, 2026-11-28, 2026-11-28, true

bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_render_float_fractional_height_dropped_2026-11-28, 0, "2026-11-28 frac-float-svg lane: fixed in layout_engine. g_float_y1_frac holds the milli-px a float's exact margin-box bottom lies past g_float_y1 (the float's returned end residual plus its bottom margin's fraction); clear on a block, a formatting-context root's auto height and a float moved down to another float's bottom read it; the float's top takes the cursor residual and its top margin in milli px. Line boxes keep whole px. Spec 1/10 on base 8b2da8a67a1, 10/10 fixed; all catalog frames byte-identical."
    web_render_float_fractional_height_dropped_2026-11-28, 1, "Not changed: <br clear> and a float inside an open line keep whole px. Paint order of a float under a later block background is web_render_float_painted_under_later_block_background_2026-11-28."
    web_render_float_fractional_height_dropped_2026-11-28, 2, "close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/browser_engine/float_fractional_height_clear_chrome159_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/browser_engine/float_fractional_height_clear_chrome159_spec.spl"

